","ming":"敬則","additional_names":[],"chapter_id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p017","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p017:m0030","quote":"省內與直閣將軍卜伯興謀其夜共攻齊王會秉去事覺齊王夜使驍騎將軍王敬則收韞韞已戒嚴敬則率壯士直前韞左右皆披靡因殺之伯興亦伏誅粲敗秉踰城出走於額檐湖見擒與二子承俁並死秉時年四十五秉妻蕭氏思話女也元徽中朝廷危殆妻常懼禍敗每謂秉曰君富貴已足故應為兒子作計年垂五十殘生何足恡邪秉不能從秉弟謨奉朝請謨弟遐字彥道亦奉朝請員外散騎侍郎與嫡母殷養女雲敷私通殷每禁之殷暴病卒未及殮口鼻流血疑遐潛加毒害為有司所糾世祖徙之始安郡永光中得還太宗世歷","status":"editorial_provisional","component_source_binding":{"kind":"fixed_wyd_song051_yixin_name_component","role":"yz_wangjingze","name_form":"source_full_name","raw_sha256":"8d2ae0cd97228ef9a252a07a5886f2f0c3d445e305f311e484b38a97f462fcad"},"human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-051","source_id":"s-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p005:m0002","start":28,"end":31,"surface":"王敬則","kind":"person","person_id":"8to_rk3_dcc","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p005","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p007:m0029","start":204,"end":207,"surface":"王敬則","kind":"person","person_id":"8to_rk3_dcc","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p007","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p008:m0002","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"王敬則","kind":"person","person_id":"8to_rk3_dcc","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p008","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p008:m0003","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"敬則","kind":"person","person_id":"8to_rk3_dcc","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p008","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p008:m0010","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"王公","kind":"person","person_id":"8to_rk3_dcc","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p008","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p008:m0011","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"王公","kind":"person","person_id":"8to_rk3_dcc","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p008","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p017:m0030","start":30,"end":33,"surface":"王敬則","kind":"person","person_id":"8to_rk3_dcc","source_role_key":"yizong-unit:yz_wangjingze","confidence":"high","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p017","chapter_id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p017:m0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"敬則","kind":"person","person_id":"8to_rk3_dcc","source_role_key":"yizong-unit:yz_wangjingze","confidence":"high","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p017","chapter_id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-nanqi047-xietiao-wife-father","subject_person_id":"8to_rk3_dcc_A","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"8to_rk3_dcc","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"敬則女","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-047","source_id":"s-nanqishu-047-current-rendered-xietiao","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p008","quote":"朓初告王敬則，敬則女爲朓妻，常懷刀欲報朓，朓不敢相見。及爲吏部郎，沈昭略謂朓曰：「卿人地之美，無忝此職。但恨今日刑于寡妻。」朓臨敗歎曰：「我不殺王公，王公由我而死。」","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p008:m-daughter","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p008:m0003"}],"interpretation_note":"依原句保存；未補母親、同母或排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-nanqi047-xietiao-wangjingze","person_id":"8to_rk3_dcc","surfaces":["王敬則","敬則","王公"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-047","source_id":"s-nanqishu-047-current-rendered-xietiao","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p005","quote":"建武四年，出爲晉安王鎮北諮議、南東海太守，行南徐州事。啓王敬則反謀，上甚嘉賞之。遷尚書吏部郎。朓上表三讓，中書疑朓官未及讓，以問祭酒沈約。約曰：「宋元嘉中，范曅讓吏部，朱脩之讓黃門，蔡興宗讓中書，竝三表詔答，具事宛然。近世小官不讓，遂成恒俗，恐此有乖讓意。王藍田、劉安西竝貴重，初自不讓，今豈可慕此不讓邪？孫興公、孔顗竝讓記室，今豈可三署皆讓邪？謝吏部今授超階，讓別有意，豈關官之大小？撝讓之美，本出人情。若大官必讓，便與詣闕章表不異。例旣如此，謂都自非疑。」朓又啓讓，上優答不許。","mention_ids":["c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p005:m0002"]},{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-047","source_id":"s-nanqishu-047-current-rendered-xietiao","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p007","quote":"東昏失德，江祐欲立夏王寶玄，末更回惑，與弟祀密謂朓曰：「江夏年少輕脫，不堪負荷神器，不可復行廢立。始安年長入纂，不乖物望。非以此要富貴，政是求安國家耳。」遙光又遣親人劉渢密致意於朓，欲以爲肺腑。朓自以受恩高宗，非渢所言，不肯答。少日，遙光以朓兼知衞尉事，朓懼見引，卽以祏等謀告左興盛，興盛不敢發言。祏聞，以告遙光，遙光大怒，乃稱敕召朓，仍回車付廷尉，與徐孝嗣、祏、暄等連名啓誅朓曰：「謝朓資性險薄，大彰遠近。王敬則往構凶逆，微有誠效，自爾昇擢，超越倫伍。而谿壑無厭，著於觸事。比遂扇動內外，處處姦說，妄貶乘輿，竊論宮禁，閒謗親賢，輕議朝宰，醜言異計，非可具聞。無君之心旣著，共棄之誅宜及。臣等參議，宜下北里，肅正刑書。」詔：「公等啓事如此，朓資性輕險，久彰物議。直以彫蟲薄伎，見齒衣冠。昔在渚宮，構扇蕃邸，日夜縱諛，仰窺俯畫。及還京師，飜自宣露，江、漢無波，以爲己功。素論於茲而盡，縉紳所以側目。去夏之事，頗有微誠，賞擢曲加，踰邁倫序，感悅未聞，陵競彌著。遂復矯構風塵，妄惑朱紫，詆貶朝政，疑閒親賢。巧言利口，見醜前志，涓流纖孽，作戒遠圖。宜有少正之刑，以申去害之義。便可收付廷尉，肅明國典。」又使御史中丞范岫奏收朓，下獄死。時年三十六。","mention_ids":["c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p007:m0029"]},{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-047","source_id":"s-nanqishu-047-current-rendered-xietiao","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p008","quote":"朓初告王敬則，敬則女爲朓妻，常懷刀欲報朓，朓不敢相見。及爲吏部郎，沈昭略謂朓曰：「卿人地之美，無忝此職。但恨今日刑于寡妻。」朓臨敗歎曰：「我不殺王公，王公由我而死。」","mention_ids":["c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p008:m0002"]},{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-047","source_id":"s-nanqishu-047-current-rendered-xietiao","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered","paragrap