子作計年垂五十殘生何足恡邪秉不能從秉弟謨奉朝請謨弟遐字彥道亦奉朝請員外散騎侍郎與嫡母殷養女雲敷私通殷每禁之殷暴病卒未及殮口鼻流血疑遐潛加毒害為有司所糾世祖徙之始安郡永光中得還太宗世歷","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p017:m0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"卜伯興","kind":"person","person_id":"j7f_anm_pau","source_role_key":"yizong-unit:yz_boboxing","confidence":"high"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p017:m0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"47p_kjh_ez7","source_role_key":"yizong-unit:yz_qigao","confidence":"high"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p017:m0018","start":18,"end":19,"surface":"秉","kind":"person","person_id":"3qs_nqa_ioa_AABDB","source_role_key":"yizong-unit:bing","confidence":"high"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p017:m0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"47p_kjh_ez7","source_role_key":"yizong-unit:yz_qigao","confidence":"high"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p017:m0030","start":30,"end":33,"surface":"王敬則","kind":"person","person_id":"8to_rk3_dcc","source_role_key":"yizong-unit:yz_wangjingze","confidence":"high"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p017:m0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"韞","kind":"person","person_id":"3qs_nqa_ioa_AABAE","source_role_key":"yizong-unit:yun","confidence":"high"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p017:m0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"韞","kind":"person","person_id":"3qs_nqa_ioa_AABAE","source_role_key":"yizong-unit:yun","confidence":"high"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p017:m0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"敬則","kind":"person","person_id":"8to_rk3_dcc","source_role_key":"yizong-unit:yz_wangjingze","confidence":"high"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p017:m0046","start":46,"end":47,"surface":"韞","kind":"person","person_id":"3qs_nqa_ioa_AABAE","source_role_key":"yizong-unit:yun","confidence":"high"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p017:m0054","start":54,"end":55,"surface":"之","kind":"pronoun","person_id":"3qs_nqa_i